### The Empirical Test

I ran a script that performs a complex regex replacement (simulating data cleaning/masking) on an array of 1 million strings. To measure the "lag," I set up a `setInterval` that logs a heartbeat every 10ms. 

**The "Lag" is the gap between the heartbeats while the loop is running.**

